OL,3,APalace in war of words with Earl
OL,4,ASpencer over claims in Diana book
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuckingham Palace is in a war of words
OL,7,Fwith Earl Spencer, the brother of
OL,8,FDiana, Princess of Wales, over a
OL,9,Fcontroversial memoir about her life and
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FKing Charles is accused of
OL,13,Finsensitively saying to Earl Spencer,
OL,14,Fin the wake of Diana's death in 1997,
OL,15,Fthat "we'll forget her soon enough",
OL,16,Faccording to excerpts published in the
OL,17,FDaily Mail.
OL,19,FBut the Palace has pushed back
OL,20,Funusually strongly, angered by the
OL,21,Fclaims and attempting to cast doubt on
OL,22,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
