OL,3,AInterest rates hold expected but Bank
OL,4,Aof England facing tough choices
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterest rates are expected to be left
OL,7,Funchanged later despite price rises
OL,8,Faccelerating due to the prolonged
OL,9,Fconflict in the Middle East.
OL,11,FThe Bank of England's nine-member
OL,12,FMonetary Policy Committee (MPC) has
OL,13,Fbeen meeting amid a backdrop of
OL,14,Fincreasing global energy prices and
OL,15,Finterest rate rises around the world.
OL,17,FEconomists expect the MPC to hold the
OL,18,Fbenchmark Bank rate at 3.75% for a
OL,19,Fsixth consecutive meeting but analysts
OL,20,Fare more divided on whether the rate
OL,21,Fwill need to go up before the end of
OL,22,Fthe year.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
