OL,3,AUncontrolled AI could lead to 'silicon
OL,4,Aspecies' rivalling humans, warns
OL,5,AMicrosoft
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of Microsoft AI has warned
OL,8,Fthat without adequate safeguards, the
OL,9,Fdevelopment of AI could lead to the
OL,10,Femergence of a new "silicon species"
OL,11,Fwich competes with humans.
OL,13,FMustafa Suleyman said rival firm
OL,14,FAnthropic is treating AI like it is
OL,15,Fhuman, an approach he called
OL,16,F"misguided" which could create
OL,17,Ftechnology that humanity cannot
OL,18,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
