OL,3,AEU announces plan to restrict social
OL,4,Amedia access for children
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe European Commission said social
OL,7,Fmedia companies would need to prove
OL,8,Ftheir platforms were safe by design,
OL,9,Fwhile EU chief Ursula von der Leyen
OL,10,Fsaid the move would "put parents back
OL,11,Fin the driving seat".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
